<title>FRANCE: French franc slips to 3.38/mark, below key level.</title>
<headline>French franc slips to 3.38/mark, below key level.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The franc slipped on Wednesday to 3.38 per mark, below the level of 3.3775 which dealers had said they thought was being defended by the Bank of France.</p>
</text>
